OL,3,GNEWSANot enough information about free
OL,4,Abus, say users
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsers of a temporary free minibus
OL,7,Fservice set up after gas works caused
OL,8,Fthe closure of part of a bus route said
OL,9,Fthe service was not publicised widely
OL,10,Fenough.
OL,12,FThe 20-seat minibus has been running in
OL,13,Fa loop from Peterborough's Bretton
OL,14,FCentre to Peterborough City Hospital
OL,15,Fand is due to end on 1 November.
OL,17,FSome passengers using the service said
OL,18,Fthey were pleased to have it, but felt
OL,19,Fit had not been advertised very well
OL,20,Fand only discovered it by chance.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
