OL,3,GNEWSANot enough information about free
OL,4,Abus, say users
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Marsh, the acting operations
OL,7,Fdirector at Stagecoach East, apologised
OL,8,Fto any customers who "felt they were
OL,9,Fnot adequately informed about the
OL,10,Ftemporary changes".
